                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hawa watafanya vita na Mwana-Kondoo, na Mwana Kondoo atawashinda, kwa maana Yeye ni Bwana wa Mabwana, na Mfalme wa Wafalme, na hao walio pamoja naye ndio walioitwa, na wateule, na waaminifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
